#: includes/class-sr-admin.php
msgid "Swarm Rebuild"
msgstr "Swarm Rebuild"

#: includes/class-sr-admin.php
msgid "Swarm Rebuild Settings"
msgstr "Swarm Rebuild 设置"

msgid ""
"Choose where the swarm can run and how visitors experience it. Visitors who "
"turned the animation off in their browser keep that choice."
msgstr ""
"选择群体重建的生效范围与访客体验。访客在自己浏览器里关闭动画的选择会被保留。"

msgid "Where to enable"
msgstr "生效范围"

msgid "Front page only"
msgstr "仅首页"

msgid "Specific URLs"
msgstr "指定 URL"

msgid "Entire site"
msgstr "整站"

msgid ""
"One path per line (e.g. about or pricing). Used when \"Specific URLs\" is "
"selected."
msgstr "每行一个路径(如 about 或 pricing),仅在范围选择“指定 URL”时使用。"

msgid "Intro mode"
msgstr "开场模式"

msgid ""
"Auto-play the rebuild once per visitor on pages in scope. Skippable and "
"respects reduced-motion."
msgstr "对范围内页面的访客自动播放一次重建动画;可跳过,并尊重系统的“减少动态”偏好。"

msgid "Visitor control card"
msgstr "访客控制卡片"

msgid "Floating card in the bottom-left corner with replay, stop and sound controls."
msgstr "左下角悬浮卡片,提供重放、关闭动画和声音控制;可收起到左缘。"

msgid "Sound on by default"
msgstr "默认开启声音"

msgid "Keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "键盘快捷键"

msgid "Alt+Shift+S triggers the rebuild on pages in scope."
msgstr "在范围内页面按 Alt+Shift+S 触发重建动画。"

msgid "Enable on mobile"
msgstr "在移动端启用"

msgid "Off by default: touch devices have no cursor metaphor."
msgstr "默认关闭:触屏设备没有光标隐喻。"

msgid "Intro end delay (seconds)"
msgstr "开场结束停留(秒)"

msgid ""
"How long the finished state lingers before auto-returning to the live page."
msgstr "重建完成后停留多久自动回到真实页面。"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Tour"
msgstr "巡览"

msgid "Touring"
msgstr "巡览中"

msgid "Auto-scroll while the swarm builds"
msgstr "随群体构建自动滚动"

msgid "Build speed"
msgstr "构建速度"

msgid "Sound (M)"
msgstr "声音 (M)"

msgid "Fade back to the real page"
msgstr "淡回真实页面"

msgid "Wipe and rebuild again"
msgstr "擦除并重新构建"

msgid "Exit (Esc)"
msgstr "退出 (Esc)"

msgid "Go live"
msgstr "回到页面"

msgid "Replay"
msgstr "重放"

msgid "Exit"
msgstr "退出"

msgid "Tap for sound"
msgstr "点击开启声音"

msgid "Sound on (M)"
msgstr "开启声音 (M)"

msgid "Sound off (M)"
msgstr "关闭声音 (M)"

msgid "<b>%d</b> agents ready"
msgstr "<b>%d</b> 位光标就绪"

msgid "Rebuilt by <b>%d</b> agents in <b>%d</b>s"
msgstr "<b>%d</b> 位光标用时 <b>%d</b> 秒重建完成"

msgid "%d × %d"
msgstr "%d × %d"

msgid "Close animation"
msgstr "关闭动画"

msgid "Sound"
msgstr "声音"

msgid "Applies from the next page load; press M during the animation."
msgstr "下次加载页面时生效;动画中可按 M 键切换。"

msgid "Hide"
msgstr "收起"

msgid "Show"
msgstr "展开"
